# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Fantasy Teams — environment configuration
#
# TWO layers, kept strictly separate:
#
# 1) VITE_* values are inlined into the browser bundle. They must only ever be
#    PUBLIC Firebase **web app** config (used for Authentication only — the
#    browser has NO direct database access; all data flows through the API).
#
# 2) Non-prefixed values (FIREBASE_*) are server-side only. They are read by
#    Netlify Functions and must NEVER be exposed to the browser.
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Browser: Firebase Auth web-app config (Firebase Console → Project
# ── settings → Your apps → Web app). Authentication only.
VITE_FIREBASE_API_KEY=AIzaSyBchvb6GSC52g_j7DRFEIC5YqWST90s9EQ
VITE_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=fantasyteams-4473b.firebaseapp.com
VITE_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=fantasyteams-4473b
VITE_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET=fantasyteams-4473b.firebasestorage.app
VITE_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID=718922917481
VITE_FIREBASE_APP_ID=1:718922917481:web:0fd716609577774358e4f8

# ── Server: Firebase Admin SDK credentials (Netlify Functions only).
# ── Service account JSON (Project settings → Service accounts → Generate key).
# ── Single-line escaped JSON, or paste the raw block with quotes preserved.
FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT=
# Realtime Database URL. If omitted it is derived from the service account's
# project_id as https://<project_id>-default-rtdb.firebaseio.com
FIREBASE_DATABASE_URL=https://fantasyteams-4473b-default-rtdb.firebaseio.com/

# ── Optional: override the API base path (default: same-origin /.netlify/functions/api)
# VITE_API_BASE=

# ── Server: NFL data source (optional override — defaults to ESPN's public
# ── site API, which is free and keyless). Server-side only.
# NFL_API_BASE=https://site.api.espn.com/apis/site/v2/sports/football/nfl

# ── Local development
# Run the UI:            npm run dev
# Run the API:           npx netlify functions:serve   (loads settings from this file)
# Run everything:        npx netlify dev               (serves Vite + API together on :8888)